NAME
    gcloud apihub discovered-api-observations - manage Discovered Api
        Observation resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud apihub discovered-api-observations GROUP | COMMAND
        [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Manage Discovered Api Observation resources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

GROUPS
    GROUP is one of the following:

     discovered-api-operations
        Manage Discovered Api Operation resources.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     describe
        Describe a Discovered Api Observation.

     list
        List Discovered Api Observations.

NOTES
    This variant is also available:

        $ gcloud alpha apihub discovered-api-observations

